      "id": "claim_6d1e2d4064314707bdf1da2b72a2ae9c",
      "statement": "Each dsh profile sees only its own data because dsh-pet-panel resolves the skills directory, MCP server config, and A2A agent registry under $DSH_HOME/profiles/<name>/, not under a profile-agnostic global home.",
