      "statement": "ProfileSkillProviderPlugin registers a FileSystemSkillProvider with includeDefaultRoots: false and customSkillDirs: [skillRoot()], so only the active profile's skills load and dsh's global ~/.dsh/skills and ~/.agents/skills roots are excluded.",
