      "statement": "The a2aConfigDir() fallback heuristic for non-profile launches checks DSH_PROFILE_DIR, then a cwd containing cordis.yml, then the global dsh home; this global-home fallback is the contamination risk shared by all three surfaces when --profile is absent or unparsable.",
